  "parameter_source": "Explicit broad exploratory bounds specified before v2 fitting; no published all-condition fitted value initializes or fixes a free parameter.",
  "hypotheses": {
    "effective": "v1 Monod/apparent-yield/loss null model; cellulose adds constitutive activity production proportional to growth-associated mass.",
    "published": "Gelain Eqs 2-10, glycerol Eq 5 literal; cellulose normalized z=A/Amax eliminates its exact scale symmetry. All remaining constants estimated only from training data. KI absorbs source manually chosen 0.15 coefficient.",
    "retained": "Hypothesis based on dry-mass assay: loss from growth-associated mass transfers fraction f_retained to measured retained dry mass, which clears at k_clear. These pools are not verified living/dead biomass.",
    "hydrolysis": "Candidate extension grounded in extracellular cellulase action: bulk consumption=k_h*F*S/(Kh+S), growth=Y*consumption; S/(K_ind+S) induces activity production. F is assay activity; fitted k_h is preparation-specific, not a unit conversion. Soluble intermediates and medium co-substrates remain unresolved.",
    "hydrolysis_retained": "Activity-driven hydrolysis with a retained dry-mass observation pool; both assumptions explicit, not inferred physiology."
  },
  "seed": 20260928,
  "starts": 3,
  "max_nfev": 250,
